<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:08.290
Is it true?

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:12.290
Yeah. Several guys have actually seen it.

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:14.420
Then have you...?

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:17.470
Nah. I mean, seriously, a ghost...

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:20.680
Hey, knock it off with the voices.

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.060
Th-That wasn't me.

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:26.810
Where?

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:28.730
Where?

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.270
You there.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.780
Please tell me.

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:37.240
My head...

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.030
Where is it?!

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:43.870
CHAPTER 69

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:48.750
GENERAL OF THE UNDERWORLD
THE KIDO, IBUKIMARU

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.000
Carrots... Potatoes...

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.000
And...?

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:56.710
Sagawado ice cream!

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:58.970
SAGAWADO
SOLD OUT

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:58.970
What?!

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.680
Aww...

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:03.260
Who are you?

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.730
I came smelling the stench of a <i>yokai</i>,

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:12.690
but it seems like you're a human.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:15.150
I-I am a human!

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.860
It's just...

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.650
I'm friends with some <i>yokai</i>.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.870
I see. So you're Mana Inuyama.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:24.490
How did you...?

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:28.830
The only human allowed to enter
the GeGeGe Forest...

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:33.380
And the girl who was used as
Nanashi's vessel.

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.880
This is a warning. Keep away from Kitaro.

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.050
<i>Yokai</i> are enemies of humans.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:44.850
You survived the Nanashi incident,
but you got lucky.

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.260
Get involved, and next time...

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.220
you will die.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:01.740
I want to go to a pool with girls
in bathing suits. Don't you guys?

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.990
I'm shrivelin' up here...

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:07.580
Kitaro, are you in?

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:13.170
That was Rei Isurugi.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:16.420
He said <i>yokai</i> were an enemy.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:21.420
He's hunting specific <i>yokai</i> for revenge,
you see.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:22.930
For revenge?

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:28.970
He's from a clan called the Kidoshu
who've sealed away <i>yokai</i> for generations.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:32.350
Their village was wiped out
by one of four evil <i>yokai</i>

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:36.770
called the Four Treasonous Generals.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:42.950
Unfortunately, Kitaro has to capture
the Four Treasonous Generals.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:45.610
And every time he gets in the way.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:47.200
But he's human.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.120
Yup.

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:50.490
He's got a foul mouth and attitude.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:54.330
He's seriously a pain in the neck.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:58.040
Mana, I'll have a crow
watch over you for a while.

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:04.800
If he shows up before you again,
I'll deal with him.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.760
I promise I won't get you involved.

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.390
Don't worry.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:21.530
That Rei boy...

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:27.660
He doesn't hurt humans,
so she should be all right.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:28.820
Dad.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:33.830
I don't trust him, nor do I feel
anyone's safe around him at all.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.710
I see.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.080
I guess so.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:44.340
Kitaro seemed kind of scary.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:50.640
You know how Kitaro tends to be
a little nonchalant about things?

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.220
How he doesn't obsess?

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:57.270
But with Rei Isurugi he's different.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:03.980
I've never seen Kitaro harbor
such strong emotions about anyone.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.990
Much less a human.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:16.500
Pity. I finally find a girl
suitable as a <i>yorimashi</i>,

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.750
and she is haunted by a cat spirit.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:21.380
Behind me, Mana!

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.920
I am Ibukimaru.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.010
KIDO

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:32.470
Feline, I have no use for you.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.560
Begone.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:34.930
Otherwise...

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.890
Otherwise what?!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.990
Cat-san!

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:53.160
Girl of blood familiar to
the realm of the dead.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:56.830
Lend me your power for a time.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.790
My power?

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.290
Defy me and that cat...

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.090
dies.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:10.380
I'm sorry.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:14.350
I was powerless against him.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.270
It's not your fault.

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:19.980
Ibukimaru is the son of Shuten-Doji.

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:23.270
He's one of the most powerful of the <i>oni</i>.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:29.030
A thousand years ago, he burned an entire
country to the ground in a single night.

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:36.030
He's an evil <i>yokai</i> whose crime earned him
nearly a thousand years in the underworld.

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:40.120
But Dad, why does Ibukimaru want Mana?

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:43.500
He mentioned something about a <i>yorimashi</i>--

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:44.790
What?!

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:49.880
A <i>yorimashi</i> is a human who can
act as a medium.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.390
Mana-chan has kin who were worshippers.

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:56.390
Could he be after her power?

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.680
Ibukimaru...!

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:00.600
There's no time!

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:06.110
Contact Kagami-Jijii and the others
to help find Mana-chan!

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:11.070
Any word?

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.740
Nothing yet.

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:18.330
Even the crows haven't found anything.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.830
A letter?

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.250
A woman's ghost haunting a dam?

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:32.010
Kitaro, what will you do?

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:35.390
I'd like to respond to
every request, but...

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:38.600
With this situation, it's kind of...

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:41.640
Why don't we check it out?

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:48.900
All we can do right now is
wait for word from the others.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.780
Kitaro, I know how you feel.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.150
But being anxious won't help.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:57.160
Why don't we leave this to
Old Man Crybaby,

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:00.490
and at least hear the request out?

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.120
Yes.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:08.460
There are also reports of it
dancing above the reservoir.

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:10.920
That seems kinda refined.

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:16.130
A small worshipping spot
or a grave or a shrine...

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.470
Is there anything like that near the dam?

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:23.350
I don't know. But I heard they tore down
a small village.

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:29.570
What?!

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.280
<i>On!</i>

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:40.830
Enough!

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:47.290
Oh no! Oh no! Oh no!

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:50.960
Kitaro, that's...!

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:51.800
I know.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.800
So you're Ibukimaru!

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.170
You are...

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:59.300
Ah. You must be GeGeGe no Kitaro.

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.310
Where's Mana?!

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:05.600
I'll get her!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:08.440
Why did you abduct Mana?!

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:10.860
It is not your concern.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:12.150
Begone.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:16.780
If not, I shall cleave you
along with this crude embankment.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:19.360
I won't let you!

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:23.830
If this dam is destroyed, the people
and town downstream will be flooded!

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:28.120
That is the humans' business.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:31.540
If it be human discretion to
destroy nature,

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:36.010
then is not destroying their creations by
my discretion...

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.550
only fair?

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:40.550
Finger--

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.770
Ibukimaru is mine!

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:00.160
<i>Sowaka.</i>

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:01.570
Wh...?!

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:12.960
My... spells...

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:14.920
Be there any mystery?

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:18.420
The way of the Kidoshu
is the way of the <i>oni</i>.

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:24.760
Your spells and curses all
have their origins in what we <i>oni</i> created.

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:26.850
<i>On.</i>

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:33.900
None shall stand in my--

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:35.400
Finger Guns!

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:44.490
GeGeGe no... Kitaro!

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.500
KAPPA

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:53.000
MYSTERIOUS NIGHT

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:53.000
-<i>"I'll turn this into money."</i>
-<i>"This idiocy might be hiding a genius."</i>
-<i>"No way."</i>

00:11:57.880 --> 00:11:58.920
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:01.840
Hair Needles!

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:10.770
What? Kitaro is?!

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:13.770
Cat-san, we have to stop them!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.900
Mana, what happened?

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:20.900
What do you want me to do?

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:27.530
Long ago, I belonged to
the clan of <i>oni</i> living on Mt. Oe.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:33.290
My father, Shuten-Doji, threatened
the city of Kyoto with his power,

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:35.790
and we proudly flaunted it.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:39.460
In retrospect, it was all so foolish.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:44.680
There were many humans
we had kidnapped on Mt. Oe.

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:49.060
To us, humans were no more than cattle.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:55.770
But, alone among them,
there was a girl who stole my heart.

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:03.530
She did not fear me.
She did not pander to me.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:09.790
She showed mercy to the weak,
and was loved by the other prisoners.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:15.290
To this girl, I found myself...

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:28.890
But such a path was forbidden
to an <i>oni</i> of Mt. Oe.

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:38.560
Thus I chose to flee Mt. Oe with her.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:50.530
We led the other captive humans...

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:54.250
and went to a village in a distant valley.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:57.710
There we made our home and lived.

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:02.840
It was a modest, yet happy life.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.010
The local villagers accepted us.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:10.390
We lived together, be we human or <i>oni</i>.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:19.150
But they came for us.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.370
Wally Wall!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:41.920
Thank goodness we made it in time!
Hop on!

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.250
Move aside!

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:46.510
Or I shall cleave you as well!

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:48.260
...Wall!

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:50.760
Ibukimaru!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:52.680
Internal Electricity!

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:57.520
Interesting.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.350
I shall use this power!

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.860
Oh no you don't!

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:13.160
Finger Guns!

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:21.670
Finger--

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.130
Wait!

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:27.970
Please, Kitaro, listen to me!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.220
"They"?

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:37.220
The ruler of the local villages
suddenly attacked our village.

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:43.690
As fate would have it,
I was absent that day.

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:51.660
By the time I rushed home...

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:03.380
To provoke me,
they had left only her head.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:05.880
And her body was taken away.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:08.880
Ibukimaru-san is just looking for her!

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:10.130
That's why...

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:15.640
Did you massacre
that entire country as revenge?!

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:18.100
Indeed!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:23.270
The ruler who took the girl's body,
and every one of his kin!

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:26.150
As well as everyone in that country!

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:31.490
I killed them all! Yet still
my wrath was unsatisfied, so...

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:33.660
I burned it all!

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:41.660
It has been a thousand years.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:47.710
I wish to lay her head to rest
with her body, so she may be at peace.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:51.470
That is my one and only wish!

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:56.090
Using the girl with the <i>yorimashi</i> power
I have finally found it!

00:16:56.220 --> 00:17:00.350
Her body lies at
the bottom of this lake!

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:02.810
Indeed, I am a criminal!

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:09.110
But does that mean I cannot even wish
peace for the one woman I ever loved?!

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:12.650
I shall show no mercy to any
who would hinder my wish!

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:15.200
If you will stand in my way,

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:19.870
I shall destroy this embankment,
even should it cost me my life!

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:23.580
I have waited a thousand years!
Do not underestimate me!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:30.380
All you want... is to see her body, right?

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.710
What?!

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.840
Then... I think I can grant that.

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.470
Will you trust me?

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:47.060
Take it away!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:51.320
That's the situation.

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:55.070
Will you wait just a little while?

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.440
Chihaya...

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.480
Forgive me...

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:33.730
for taking so long.

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:39.410
Thank you.

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:00.760
I have no regrets.

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:04.220
Either of you may have me.

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:06.810
Ibukimaru.

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:10.480
Did you burn my village?

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:11.690
No.

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:17.240
But I see. You too are bound by revenge.

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:23.120
Enma! I know you are watching!

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:25.620
I have no more business here.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.330
Come to collect me!

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:47.270
I offer you my thanks...

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:48.270
Kitaro.

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:51.230
Ibukimaru...

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:55.150
You stand between <i>yokai</i> and human.

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.440
Heed my warning.

00:19:57.570 --> 00:20:01.150
Two races cannot share one world.

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:05.330
There is only
the rare mixing of individuals.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:10.290
<i>Yokai</i> and human have always,
still do, and shall always,

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:17.380
at times fearfully connect, at times hate,
as we continue killing each other.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:20.380
However...

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:24.300
if you will persist...

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.390
so be it.

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:34.350
Should your wish be granted after it all,
I, too, would like to see it.

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:37.360
Descendant of the Kidoshu.

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:41.530
I was once driven by revenge, too.

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:44.870
Thus I must warn you...

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:48.160
The satisfaction of revenge is fleeting.

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:53.170
All that shall remain is exhaustion
and waves of bitterness.

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:55.000
I already know that.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:57.420
But I won't stop...

00:20:57.540 --> 00:20:58.630
I can't stop!

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:02.130
So be it. Then continue your path.

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.340
You are the same as Kitaro.

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:11.480
Perhaps you shall find a different
outcome than I did!

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:24.860
<i>So at last we have two of
the four Generals' souls back.</i>

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:29.160
<i>I hear one remains
in the hands of a human.</i>

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:32.290
<i>Be warned. Should you fail...</i>

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:35.670
Don't worry. I promise I'll get it back.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:37.960
<i>Very well.</i>

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:43.300
<i>That leaves only one left unaccounted for.</i>

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.930
And that one is the one who
burned the village of the Kidoshu.

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:55.480
The Kyubi no Kitsune...

00:21:55.600 --> 00:21:57.270
Tamamo-no-Mae.

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>Ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>Clop-clop-clop on a moonlit night</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>kankara kororin tsukiyo no ban ni</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>They gather to the clopping of geta</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>geta wo narashite yatsura ga atsumarya</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>Daddy Eyeball in his bath bowl</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>medama no oyaji chawan no furo de</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>A single lecture and everyone consents</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>sekkyou ippatsu nattoku</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>We teach the rampant ones a lesson</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>yaritai houdai no minasama niwa
okyu mo suemasu</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>We can't just do nothing</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>hottokenai desyo</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>To the mysterious GeGeGe Forest</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>fushigi na GeGeGe no Mori e</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>Take a deep breath together</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>issyo ni shinkokyu</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>So we can live happily</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>waratte kuraseru youni</i>

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:03.460
<i>An edict that has been passed down.</i>

00:23:03.590 --> 00:23:07.170
<i>Dad, why don't humans fear curses?</i>

00:23:07.720 --> 00:23:10.090
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:10.220 --> 00:23:12.350
<i>"Spirit Affliction
Mysterious Footprints"</i>

00:23:12.470 --> 00:23:14.970
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
